# Dreamball / dreamball-server environment template.
# Copy to .env and fill in your values; .env is gitignored.

# ─── Embedding backend (priority order at boot) ──────────────────────────────
#
#   1. DREAMBALL_EMBED_MOCK=1
#        Deterministic blake3-seeded mock. Use for CI, Storybook, unit tests.
#
#   2. RUNPOD_SERVERLESS_ENDPOINT_ID + RUNPOD_API_KEY
#        Remote RunPod Serverless GPU running Ollama qwen3-embedding:0.6b
#        (same worker image as the sibling Negotiated project).
#
#   3. None of the above → server boot fails fast.
#
#   There is NO in-process model provider. dreamball-server used to host
#   Qwen3 ONNX weights via @huggingface/transformers; that was removed on
#   2026-08-07 (docs/decisions/2026-08-07-substrate-palace-boundary.md).
#   For local weights, run your own `text-embed/1` provider process.

# DREAMBALL_EMBED_MOCK=1
# RUNPOD_API_KEY="rpa_..."
# RUNPOD_SERVERLESS_ENDPOINT_ID="..."
# DREAMBALL_EMBED_RUNPOD_MODEL="qwen3-embedding:0.6b"
